title: "Gym Companion"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-11"
abstract: >
  Gym Companion is a two-app fitness-companion system: a FastAPI backend implementing
  Clean Architecture with deterministic, explainable rule engines (readiness, nutrition,
  progressive overload, safety, goal alignment, training load, exercise recommendation),
  and a Flutter mobile client covering six feature modules (Today, Train, Fuel, Progress,
  Readiness, Coach). Built first for a single user, with every architectural decision
  recorded as an ADR.
